# AI Haiku Generator

## Project Overview

The AI Haiku Generator is a Python-based application developed for the Nautilus AI Development Team. It uses the OpenAI API to generate short, expressive three-line poems based on a user-provided topic.

The application accepts a topic as input and sends a parameterized prompt to an AI chat model, instructing it to follow the traditional 5-7-5 syllable structure.

## Objectives

- Initialize an OpenAI client using environment variables.
- Create a reusable `generate_haiku(topic: str) -> str` function.
- Generate haikus based on dynamically supplied topics.
- Follow the traditional three-line, 5-7-5 syllable format.
- Display the generated poem in the terminal.

## Technologies Used

